<title>USA: CommNet Cellular Q1 Dec 31 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>CommNet Cellular Q1 Dec 31 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Condensed Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		   (Amounts in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>					     For the three months ended</p>
<p>						12/31/96	   12/31/95</p>
